    <name>Integral Gredos: Desde Morezón hasta Galana</name><name><![CDATA[Integral Gredos: Desde Morezón hasta Galana]]></name><cmt><![CDATA[Circular de Gredos partiendo desde la Plataforma de Gredos.
Hacemos cumbre en: Morezón, La Ventana, base y Portilla de los Tres Hermanitos, Portilla de los Machos, Cuchillar de las Navajas (con el paso del Sagrao), Portilla Bermeja, Almanzor, Portilla de los Cobardes y la Galana.
Bajada al refugio Elola y vuelta a la Plataforma de Gredos.]]></cmt><desc><![CDATA[Circular de Gredos partiendo desde la Plataforma de Gredos.
Hacemos cumbre en: Morezón, La Ventana, base y Portilla de los Tres Hermanitos, Portilla de los Machos, Cuchillar de las Navajas (con el paso del Sagrao), Portilla Bermeja, Almanzor, Portilla de los Cobardes y la Galana.
Bajada al refugio Elola y vuelta a la Plataforma de Gredos.]]></desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="40.275343" lon="-5.232116"><ele>1779.098</ele><time>2018-09-01T05:52:46Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.275297" lon="-5.232147"><ele>1779.015</ele><time>2018-09-01T05:52:51Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.275254" lon="-5.23217"><ele>1779.026</ele><time>2018-09-01T05:52:57Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.27521" lon="-5.23221"><ele>1779.008</ele><time>2018-09-01T05:53:04Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.275165" lon="-5.232237"><ele>1779.091</ele><time>2018-09-01T05:53:09Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.275111" lon="-5.232265"><ele>1779.047</ele><time>2018-09-01T05:53:13Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.275064" lon="-5.232291"><ele>1779.061</ele><time>2018-09-01T05:53:17Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.27502" lon="-5.232316"><ele>1779.080</ele><time>2018-09-01T05:53:21Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.27497" lon="-5.23234"><ele>1779.041</ele><time>2018-09-01T05:53:25Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.274921" lon="-5.232357"><ele>1779.086</ele><time>2018-09-01T05:53:28Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.274871" lon="-5.232368"><ele>1779.049</ele><time>2018-09-01T05:53:32Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.274824" lon="-5.232377"><ele>1779.078</ele><time>2018-09-01T05:53:36Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.274776" lon="-5.23239"><ele>1779.011</ele><time>2018-09-01T05:53:41Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.274727" lon="-5.232421"><ele>1779.021</ele><time>2018-09-01T05:53:46Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.27469" lon="-5.232456"><ele>1779.003</ele><time>2018-09-01T05:53:50Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.274651" lon="-5.232496"><ele>1778.308</ele><time>2018-09-01T05:53:54Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.274609" lon="-5.23254"><ele>1779.193</ele><time>2018-09-01T05:53:59Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.274568" lon="-5.232567"><ele>1778.499</ele><time>2018-09-01T05:54:03Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.274524" lon="-5.232599"><ele>1777.253</ele><time>2018-09-01T05:54:07Z</time></trkpt><trkpt lat="40.274487" lon="-5.232641"><ele>1778.12